{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8Zq-pmq_hzz0Vq_a-ewSjg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:24.263913+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8Zq-pmq_hzz0Vq_a-ewSjg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span>一流的师资条件</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>中科院院士：1人</span></span></p><p><span>长江特聘教授：4人</span></p><p><span>国家杰出青年基金获得者：11人</span></p><p><span>国家优秀青年人才计划获得者：17人</span></p><p><span>百千万人才工程领军人才：1人</span></p><p><span>科技创新领军人才：3人</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>现代光学研究所作为北京大学物理学院重要组成部分，底蕴深厚、气氛和睦，是“人工微结构和介观物理全国重点实验室”和“纳光电子前沿科学中心”的重要组成部分，经费充足、条件完善。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>为学生开拓国际视野，现代光学研究所与国际顶级研究机构和大学保持着频繁的学术交流，鼓励学生参加各种本领域国际学术会议。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span>前沿的研究方向</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>介观光学与微纳光子学</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>研究从波长、亚波长迈进到深亚波长尺度下光与物质相互作用的新物理，探索强局域约束下光场调控的新方法和新技术，实现新型高性能介观光子器件与集成芯片，应用于光通信、光计算、传感测量、高速信息处理等重要领域。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"介观.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZW6QN4Lf6SSUty9jYL41HYEGhCTTYKQOwTg8WJRPwzzWV7hWML3Eib1hCxkYzBQedGMpZd6j9RbVlynPkQjDzb6Be6mRG8mMzow/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>超快科学与非线性光学</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>发展新型飞秒和阿秒激光技术，揭示超快强场极端物理条件下原子分子物理的新现象与新规律，重点研究原子分子超快控制及成像、极端超快非线性光学、强场量子光学效应、超高时空分辨光谱和光电子成像等。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"超快.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZWNocYdkFu2OrSoPAWmjaZJmRTojcujn9TkKKJLxbibKj3YtQLh6ZCn8kJU2FIVk9xxLkLtMNCnIozEDUGy9oVIq8OXCsmHwnHQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>量子光学与光量子芯片</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>研究量子纠缠的检测及其应用，研制高质量量子光源和单光子探测器，实现高性能量子计算与模拟，构建多功能量子网络，制备大规模集成光量子芯片;利用多光子非线性过程实现超快高分辨成像、三维微纳制造等。</span></span></span></p><section><img alt=\"量子.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZUr21P7kGmGXGLPPGD7Qdia0z0P8PNAZElDAicMibNpbjKFfwULQRI75IcaMMNeFgvt1YCAfaCiauT9WUNhXzBx3ibxJ6tBk9uGxQxs/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>阿秒物理与超冷原子物理</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>研究原子分子在超短强激光脉冲作用下的动力学过程，探讨激光场对原子分子动力学行为的量子操控，原子和分子的光谱测量，以及原子与分子在外场中动力学行为的理论模拟和实验研究等；利用超冷原子量子模拟拓扑物态和多体无序现象；基于里德宝原子阵列的量子计算和精密测量。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"阿秒.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZXt2c3DhRm3npia5aqFKE5JWMc2TibH1eA14Ug4ROicDB5YGORia6GshhFia172C31DEvpEGe9VfmES72D45sY6x4Ia9HbNrI73ILg8/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>光电功能分子与材料和器件</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>深入认知材料和器件结构与性能的构效关系，发展基于高性能、低成本的新型介观光电功能材料体系，开发高效率轻质光伏技术、宽色域高刷新率光电显示技术以及高灵敏度全波段光电探测技术，服务国家“碳达峰”和“碳中和”战略。</span></span></span></p><section><img alt=\"光电1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZWvHpOMa3AU3oJZIjzlhchZL1v5YwFa7Qic3fmtIgzcCRWqmAJW6mbPzicVAk436FVasYDE2exibnZoWXeiaj7M7Vlyw4tLzZtvPVw/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span>先进的设备平台</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"主席视察平台.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/BmHLnicgb5ZUbX3tkKZ2ST5IYwRPW7XPxQfbs0XHseic9JHJrHF2L2EcehvAbx8TT9CUVNjE3mSJgbTDD1XsDqPYuLH5Y6iaRrkXNBQxSgd6S4/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"peem.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZW83Vd5vJIWmkQvfsPYapD3HCviaU3FCC45RlAcXDFnfuHnC39PSdHmeuCvZ6bia9aPjMzibhhey4qJAEjcibBZXIPbwHRlsk8J7pI/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>在超快时间和超小空间尺度上测量和调控电子行为可以揭示量子世界的基本规律，进而为人类开发新材料、设计新结构、以及施加外场等手段操纵光电子行为行为提供支持，指导设计和和优化光电子信息器件功能。现代光学研究所围绕超快时间和超小空间分辨开展研究，研制了多套国际先进的实验装置，并建成飞秒-纳米时空分辨实验平台，同时实现超快时间和超小空间分辨测量。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"微信图片_20250108095752.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZUSDA67M262yzyhAUapWCpSbbpD2FMbyZXoSvMGibVIaAY3IdlVJcDRibc8Otx8tKXFRCNPIKmVWBAia2ev8jz0VYibWBv7eh2SO6A/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"微信图片_20250108095758.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZWmaSmYWIIWZkeY9ZsJJibZggMrtRYULZypLAVzSo84MHfUrhJZpQaPTLbZZJGgwiaOl1ZicCxFVeYhciabdibricHjJ0amsJiamaKZAY/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"微信图片_20250108095720.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZWWib87XCrGT2XlDY0KmnIOrzGE59N9ORF4EcFjTlB86uoW9Q8HLic7SEA41mZIVERkFlqT46iaETRk1ibBgstS6nBkdV37JEibgPlM/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"微信图片_20250108095731.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZW0yXvRXiaqicKlBIMbWInJvC2Z8oJW2whHd9Wc6KaRUhD7uCRUWoo6dpMQtPrd8SibAc0iaNibiaBSaEVWhuyIfUSc1zoIYrqFk2M6Y/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>依托纳光电子前沿科学中心的纳光电子加工与测试平台，配备了大量的高端加工测试设备。作为校级公共平台，将为高校和企业提供科研与产业化开发支撑。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span>丰富的科研生活</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"0E2A2703.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZU0Nn2rl2dRTh2qNVRd8ibcrPOPpbadMfAZ6icAGzSvXTJRHwFOPibTQ2kOeLuIfMibPicAMPRVOVgH2KrHTvMXPC41uTvShf8cNibEI/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>光学所举办丰富的学术活动，并受到SPIE、OSA北京大学分会的支持。除诸多国内国外交流的机会外，光学所还经常邀请国内外的学术名家、科技新锐前来与师生讨论。特别设立“所长奖学金”，用以奖励科研工作突出的同学们，激励大家不断努力。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"2024北京大学开学第一跑.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZVymDd2f4YibQB9SexvWTv6mKAia4Wh4sAMp9us1lzOyjwJdRydVIf9WwVRyAXun1kic0bCsoAI5CgqZLTSk6bQyDhmiadyVV73QxA/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>在学术活动之外，北大深厚的人文气息支撑起了学生丰富的文化活动。“大师身旁宜聆教，未名湖畔好读书”，在未名波光和博雅塔影里，浮躁的心总能平静下来。但这里绝不仅仅只有平静，二百多个学生社团、“北大剧星”、“十佳歌手”等品牌项目，一定会让你的生活更加精彩。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span>优秀毕业生感言</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"韩猛.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZVOfWTaoF2dqKPHicVhFQKGpUTmWvib6YQ7wsTPVtRlKibtghLukkMBtDUO3YMpY8vbn7OTKsIV97Xic55iciazhtqqFaT9Vibr6srehg/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"唐水晶.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BmHLnicgb5ZW9QJ6uibBAFHTwawHeo7ibic4LYOTFuELBnnjWoic3G67RcOfqoAXCXVZUw8iaibZjI9kiaxREu6qz0Fs1R9hsxf5nZoCmtWpCZ2Tia4M/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><se